			subtitle: "Chapters are the tabs down the left edge."
			icon: "minecraft:book"
			description: ["This is the whole book. Chapters are the tabs down the left edge; this one is the top one and it never locks.", "", "Every quest is drawn from the day you open it. A quest you cannot start yet sits greyed out with its title and subtitle still readable, so you can see what is coming and how far off it is."]
