			title: "The Next Line"
			subtitle: "One popup per quest, pointing forward."
			icon: "minecraft:paper"
			description: ["When a quest ticks, one popup slides in at the top right. It starts with Next: and it names what to do after this, where it is, and who is standing there.", "", "Rewards arrive by themselves at the same moment. There is nothing to click for them."]
			x: 4.0d
