			title: "Oda's Counter Is the Shortcut"
			subtitle: "She sells the dull half for Scrip."
			icon: "valley:scrip"
			description: ["Oda's Counter is a second tab, under Side Quests. It opens once her store does.", "", "Cooking, fishing, planting and running parcels pay Valley Scrip. Scrip buys casings, alloys, ducts, seeds and furniture over her counter. If a crafting step is annoying, buy it instead."]
			x: 0.0d
