			subtitle: "Josie's notes, and the way to the farm."
			icon: "patchouli:guide_book"
			description: ["The Valley Journal is in your bag. Right-click it: five entries in Josie's hand, and a field note for every machine the book asks you to build.", "", "The compass next to it points at the Kettle farm, not at spawn."]
