			description: ["Marnie, Bram, Oda, Halden, Tobin, Wisp, Pip and Nella.", "", "Right-click any of them and they say something. What they say changes as their part of the valley moves, so the same neighbour on day forty is not the sentence you got on day three. The bar at the top of the screen counts them."]
